   "title": "参考图 + 歌声 + 提示词（音画同步）",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Use <Picture 1> as the exact face, moustache, long chin beard and tall black two-tier square scholar hat of the man. <Picture 2> shows the first frame: him on a concert stage in a light cream wide-sleeved robe with broad dark brown borders and a black silk sash, holding a black wireless handheld microphone just below his chin, never covering his mouth. Keep the same stage, costume, framing and light as <Picture 2>. His free hand moves only now and then, each time a different small shape, never pointing, never waving above his shoulder. His tall black hat keeps exactly the shape and look it has in the first frame, from the first frame to the last. He sings to the audience, bright and eager, like calling an old friend out to see the moon: on 「怀民，开门」 his free hand rises to chest height, fingers loosely curled with gaps between them, and he taps twice in the air with his bent knuckles, a small, light movement of the wrist, like knocking softly on a wooden door; on 「月亮都爬上墙」 he opens the hand, palm up, and shows the moon on the screen behind him; on 「再不出来」 he leans in with raised eyebrows and a grin and beckons with the open hand, fingers waving towards himself; on 「好景可不等人赏」 the open hand comes down and rests at his side. The big screen behind him keeps exactly the picture it shows in the first frame, the full moon over the river at night, from the first frame to the last. One continuous shot: the camera trucks slowly sideways at the same distance; it does not push in. The shot never comes closer than it starts; no close-up of the face.  His lips follow every word of the vocal in <Audio 1>, press fully together on every M, B and P sound, on 民, 门, 爬 and 不, and open on the vowels. The words are: 怀民，开门！月亮都爬上墙，再不出来，好景可不等人赏。 Use <Audio 1> exactly as it is as the sound of the shot, no other sound, no subtitles or captions. ",
    1344,
    768,
    243,
    "match"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "prompt": "Use <Picture 1> as the exact face, moustache, long chin beard and tall black two-tier square scholar hat of the man. <Picture 2> shows the first frame: him on a concert stage in a light cream wide-sleeved robe with broad dark brown borders and a black silk sash, holding a black wireless handheld microphone just below his chin, never covering his mouth. Keep the same stage, costume, framing and light as <Picture 2>. His free hand moves only now and then, each time a different small shape, never pointing, never waving above his shoulder. His tall black hat keeps exactly the shape and look it has in the first frame, from the first frame to the last. He sings to the audience, bright and eager, like calling an old friend out to see the moon: on 「怀民，开门」 his free hand rises to chest height, fingers loosely curled with gaps between them, and he taps twice in the air with his bent knuckles, a small, light movement of the wrist, like knocking softly on a wooden door; on 「月亮都爬上墙」 he opens the hand, palm up, and shows the moon on the screen behind him; on 「再不出来」 he leans in with raised eyebrows and a grin and beckons with the open hand, fingers waving towards himself; on 「好景可不等人赏」 the open hand comes down and rests at his side. The big screen behind him keeps exactly the picture it shows in the first frame, the full moon over the river at night, from the first frame to the last. One continuous shot: the camera trucks slowly sideways at the same distance; it does not push in. The shot never comes closer than it starts; no close-up of the face.  His lips follow every word of the vocal in <Audio 1>, press fully together on every M, B and P sound, on 民, 门, 爬 and 不, and open on the vowels. The words are: 怀民，开门！月亮都爬上墙，再不出来，好景可不等人赏。 Use <Audio 1> exactly as it is as the sound of the shot, no other sound, no subtitles or captions. ",
    "width": 1344,
    "height": 768,
    "length": 243,
    "ref_image_size": "match"
   }
